            " Models (LLMs) access to specific, private, or up-to-date data without the need to retrain the",
            "model itself.",
            "Think of an LLM as a brilliant student taking an exam. Without RAG, the student relies.",
            "entirely on their memory (their training data). With RAG, the student is allowed to use an.",
            "open textbook to look up specific facts before answering.",
